{"id":"n58720-1-13","stage":1,"title":"배탈 · 腹痛","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58720-1-13-1","ko":"승규는 또 화장실에 갔어?","zh":"承奎又去厕所了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장실에","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔어?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/163265a91c38108d06f6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58720-1-13-2","ko":"응. 아까 그렇게 많이 먹더니 배탈이 난 모양이야.","zh":"嗯。他刚才吃了那么多，看来是吃坏肚子了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹더니","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배탈이","meaning":"腹痛，腹泻","explanation":"배탈：腹痛，腹泻；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배탈","audio":"/audio/589abc9abd174bd38d91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58720","senseId":"1","lemma":"배탈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"发生身体不适；배탈이 나다 指闹肚子","explanation":"나다：发生身体不适；배탈이 나다 指闹肚子；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양이야.","meaning":"像，好像","explanation":"모양：像，好像；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"589abc9abd174bd3","term":"배탈","zh":"腹痛，腹泻","audio":"/audio/589abc9abd174bd38d91.mp3","entryId":"58720","definition":"出现消化不良、拉肚子或肚子疼等症状的疾病。","pronunciation":["배탈"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生身体不适；배탈이 나다 指闹肚子","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"发生身体不适；배탈이 나다 指闹肚子","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"像，好像","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62398","definition":"表示估计或推测。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/9768146c0ff94fe559d7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58720","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9453,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。他刚才吃了那么多，看来是吃坏肚子了。","承奎又去厕所了吗？","把承奎送到美国去留学怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎又去厕所了吗？","把承奎送到美国去留学怎么样？","嗯。他刚才吃了那么多，看来是吃坏肚子了。"],"answer":2}]}
